{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50004","headline":"句 · 惠文太子","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渭水桥边春已渡，灞陵原上雨初晴。\n清冷池里冰初合，红粉楼中月未圆。\n可惜韶年三日暮，风光由绕碧燕觞。\n晚日半衔西苑树，晴云直卷上天风。\n离筵风日三晡晚，归路云霞一道开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"惠文太子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50004.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50004","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}